    "message": "Detect phone numbers in Run artifacts as the store does\n\nRun artifacts and the saved-Run inspector took any run of ten or more\ndigits and separators for a phone number, so DOIs in model references,\nsuch as doi:10.1080/01621459.1974.10480137, were replaced with\n[REDACTED] in manifest.json (#190). The store's own check only matches\nthree separated digit groups.\n\nMake that definition public as PHONE_NUMBER in storage/projects and use\nit in both places, as EMAIL_ADDRESS already is. Separated numbers such\nas 090-1234-5678 are still redacted; unseparated digits are not, as in\nthe store.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
